om your bags: {npc:5900} gives you another."] = "Only if the Fire Sapta is gone from your bags: Telf gives you another.", ["{npc:5907} hands you the {item:6653}: keep it until the end of the chain."] = "Kranal hands you the Torch of the Dormant Flame: keep it until the end of the chain." },
