				{
					title = "The {npc:5895}",
					note = "Click the {object:113791} to place the bracers and the drops. A few seconds later the pure {npc:5895} rises on the stone in the middle of the pool: speak to it while the {spell:8202} lasts (drink again by the stone if it has worn off). It gives you the {item:7813} for {npc:5901}. Gone before you could speak to it? Back at {npc:5901} ask for {quest:63} (a fresh {quest:972} for {npc:7007}, who stands just west of the shrine): hand it to Tiev, stay close while he calls the spirit back, then speak to it.",
