sand Needles", ["zone:1454"] = "Orgrimmar", ["zone:1456"] = "Thunder Bluff" },
			written = { ["A short walk north of the Galak camps, the cave of {area:1557} leads down to its deepest chamber, where the {object:20807} burns. Use the {item:5868} on it, then loot the {item:5869} at once: the flame only stays out briefly, and if it relights the phial is gone. Then east to {npc:2986}'s mesa.\nCareful: Two Galak Flame Guards (30) stand by the brazier and a centaur guard walks the cave: pull them away one at a time before you douse the flame."] = "A short walk north of the Galak camps, the cave of Splithoof Hold leads down to its deepest chamber, where the Ancient Brazier burns. Use the Filled Etched Phial on it, then loot the Cloven Hoof at once: the flame only stays out briefly, and if it relights the phial is gone. Then east to Dorn's mesa.\nCareful: Two Galak Flame Guards (30) stand by the brazier and a centaur guard walks the cave: pull them away one at a time before you douse the flame.", ["Back east to {area:484}: it lies on the way from {area:487} to {npc:2986}'s mesa."] = "Back east to Freewind Post: it lies on the way from Roguefeather Den to Dorn's mesa.", ["Back south-west to {area:421}. {npc:12759}, a corrupted water elemental, drifts around the lake's island and under the water. She drops the {item:16408} only once you have {quest:25} from {npc:12737}; it starts a quest for Splintertree."] = "Back south-west to Mystral Lake. Tideress, a corrupted water elemental, drifts around the lake's island and under the water. She drops the Befouled Water Globe only once you have Stonetalon Standstill from Mastok; it starts a quest for Splintertree.", ["Climb the path to the top of {area:2097}. {npc:10646} is held captive beside {npc:10896} (29): clear the guards and {npc:10896} first, then free her and protect her on the walk down; Grimtotem ambushers come at you on the way."] = "Climb the path to the top of Darkcloud Pinnacle. Lakota Windsong is held captive beside Arnak Grimtotem (29): clear the guards and Arnak first, then free her and protect her on the walk down; Grimtotem ambushers come at you on the way.", ["Kill the {npc:10720} that comes for {npc:10638}"] = "Kill the Galak Assassin that comes for Kanati", ["Short of 28.9? The Grimtotem around these camps (25-28) are the right level: kill a few more before the climb to {npc:10646}. Past it, this step skips itself. Or, with a group, run the {area:2797} dungeon or the {area:1717} dungeon instead."] = "Short of 28.9? The Grimtotem around these camps (25-28) are the right level: kill a few more before the climb to Lakota. Past it, this step skips itself. Or, with a group, run the Blackfathom Deeps dungeon or the Razorfen Kraul dungeon instead.", ["The Laughing Sisters, dryads, wander {area:426} around {npc:12677}'s woods; one of them drops {npc:4721}'s {item:5867}, which can take several kills."] = "The Laughing Sisters, dryads, wander Raynewood Retreat around Shadumbra's woods; one of them drops Zangen's Etched Phial, which can take several kills.", ["The Wanted poster beside {npc:10537}"] = "The Wanted poster beside Cliffwatcher", ["{area:485}"] = "The Great Lift", ["{area:485}, down into {zone:1441}"] = "The Great Lift, down into Thousand Needles", ["{npc:10428}'s next quest, Sacred Fire, ends in {zone:1456}, off this route. Skip it."] = "Motega's next quest, Sacred Fire, ends in Thunder Bluff, off this route. Skip it.", ["{npc:12736} offers a {area:2797} quest next; leave it unless you have a group."] = "Je'neu offers a Blackfathom Deeps quest next; leave it unless you have a group.", ["{npc:3024} stands beside {npc:4721}, east of {npc:2995}."] = "Tah Winterhoof stands beside Zangen, east of Tal.", ["{npc:4499}, a hard-hitting rock elemental, walks the cliffs of {area:482}, back west past {area:2237}. {npc:4499} is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "Rok'Alim, a hard-hitting rock elemental, walks the cliffs of Highperch, back west past Whitereach Post. Rok'Alim the Pounder is elite: grouping up is advised.", ["{npc:4722} stands in {area:484}: {npc:4721}'s filled phial is for him."] = "Rau Cliffrunner stands in Freewind Post: Zangen's filled phial is for him." },
