			written = { ["South along the coast, the Southsea pirates hold the cove. {npc:7883} and the stolen cargo are on the docks at its far end. Any pirate can drop a hat, the kidnappers most often.\nCareful: Two or three pirates stand with {npc:7883}, and many more pirates from the town join the fight once it starts."] = "South along the coast, the Southsea pirates hold the cove. Andre Firebeard and the stolen cargo are on the docks at its far end. Any pirate can drop a hat, the kidnappers most often.\nCareful: Two or three pirates stand with Andre, and many more pirates from the town join the fight once it starts.", ["The shadow mages, rogues and assassins camp south-east of {area:976}.\nSouth-east of Gadgetzan the Wastewander bandits camp in the dunes; {npc:7847} stands in the eastern camp.\nCareful: Wastewander Rogues keep Sneak up while out of combat, so hidden rogues can join a fight you start at a camp.\nCareful: Two stealthed Wastewander Rogues travel with him wherever he goes. At his spawn camp, two shadowmages and their minions are close enough to join a fight with him. Out by the towers you can fight him without them."] = "The shadow mages, rogues and assassins camp south-east of Gadgetzan.\nSouth-east of Gadgetzan the Wastewander bandits camp in the dunes; Caliph stands in the eastern camp.\nCareful: Wastewander Rogues keep Sneak up while out of combat, so hidden rogues can join a fight you start at a camp.\nCareful: Two stealthed Wastewander Rogues travel with him wherever he goes. At his spawn camp, two shadowmages and their minions are close enough to join a fight with him. Out by the towers you can fight him without them." },
