				{
					title = "{area:538}: kill these as you meet them",
					note = "Ride south-west to {area:537}, the volcano in the middle of the crater. Bloodpetal Flayers grow around its foot.\nSouth of the hot springs, Stegodons graze and Dinosaur Bones drop from them or lie on the ground; Diemetradons nearby carry the scales {npc:9998} wants. Ravasaurs hunt in packs in the south-west: their claws are for {npc:8659}, and now and then one carries a Mangled Journal (a rare drop: take its quest only if you get one). Avoid Gruff, a level 57 Stegodon.\nRide south-west along the western cliffs. {npc:9167} fly over the west side, and Bloodpetal Trappers grow in the same jungle.",
